type: software
title: "gd-sgd-polynomial-fitting"
abstract: "Code and data for a closed-form comparison of gradient descent and stochastic gradient descent on polynomial regression, covering stability thresholds, noise-floor scaling under reshuffled and i.i.d. sampling, iteration parity, a synthetic twin with known noise, and decaying step sizes."
